{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55643","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十一 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲思尘世大悠哉，进趣门中尽可该。\n抛却工夫平世路，枉劳心力构仙台。\n隘空云水千重合，匝野烟霞一径开。\n幸有圆成平坦处，辛勤谁解望山来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}